{"id":5671,"date":"2025-12-23T14:40:57","date_gmt":"2025-12-23T05:10:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?page_id=5671"},"modified":"2025-12-29T11:27:18","modified_gmt":"2025-12-29T01:57:18","slug":"what-is-product-data-feeds","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/","title":{"rendered":"What is a Product Data Feed"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5671\" class=\"elementor elementor-5671\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4e2b624 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"4e2b624\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;gradient&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f31a3c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3f31a3c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4f0dda e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a4f0dda\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c89718a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c89718a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25089c9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"25089c9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8aa1282 elementor-icon-list--layout-inline elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"8aa1282\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items elementor-inline-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-inline-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-home\" viewBox=\"0 0 576 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M280.37 148.26L96 300.11V464a16 16 0 0 0 16 16l112.06-.29a16 16 0 0 0 15.92-16V368a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h64a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v95.64a16 16 0 0 0 16 16.05L464 480a16 16 0 0 0 16-16V300L295.67 148.26a12.19 12.19 0 0 0-15.3 0zM571.6 251.47L488 182.56V44.05a12 12 0 0 0-12-12h-56a12 12 0 0 0-12 12v72.61L318.47 43a48 48 0 0 0-61 0L4.34 251.47a12 12 0 0 0-1.6 16.9l25.5 31A12 12 0 0 0 45.15 301l235.22-193.74a12.19 12.19 0 0 1 15.3 0L530.9 301a12 12 0 0 0 16.9-1.6l25.5-31a12 12 0 0 0-1.7-16.93z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\"><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-inline-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">&gt;<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-inline-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-feed-course\/\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Learning &gt;<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item elementor-inline-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">What Is a Product Data Feed<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1655c8f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1655c8f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Is a Product Data Feed?<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61d9547 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"61d9547\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A product data feed is the digital DNA of your online store. It\u2019s how platforms like<strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> Google<\/span>, <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Microsoft<\/span>,<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Meta<\/strong><\/span>, and <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Amazon<\/strong><\/span> learn what you sell, who it\u2019s for, and how to display it. When you run shopping ads or list products on marketplaces, your product feed is the language that connects your store\u2019s catalog to every ad or listing customers see.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0a42c7d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0a42c7d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d798ed elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2d798ed\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad-1024x576.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5681\" alt=\"Example of a Product Data Feed or ecommerce showing product images, titles, descriptions, and prices used in Google Shopping, Meta ads, and online marketplaces - FeedOps Learning\u200b\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad-1024x576.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad-300x169.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad-768x432.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad-1536x864.png 1536w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/what-is-a-product-data-feed-ecommerce-shopping-ad.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-337363b elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-align-right elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"337363b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"#quiz\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Take the Quiz<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7513d30 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7513d30\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-783a881 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"783a881\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">By the end of this lesson, you\u2019ll understand:\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0c6b10e elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"0c6b10e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#definition\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-dot-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">What a product feed actually is<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#how\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-dot-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">How it acts as the language between your store and ad platforms<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#why\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-dot-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Why feed quality matters more than ever in AI-driven advertising<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#data\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-dot-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Why your website data quality matters<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#optimized\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-dot-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Connected vs optimized feeds<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#standards\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-dot-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm80 248c0 44.112-35.888 80-80 80s-80-35.888-80-80 35.888-80 80-80 80 35.888 80 80z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Standards used by major platforms<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3b97450 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3b97450\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f506422 elementor-widget elementor-widget-menu-anchor\" data-id=\"f506422\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"menu-anchor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-menu-anchor\" id=\"definition\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ef36cdc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ef36cdc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60d3cea e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"60d3cea\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b08155b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b08155b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1524\"><b>What a Product Data Feed Actually is?<\/b><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A <\/span><b>product feed<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a structured data file that contains detailed information about every product you sell \u2014 titles, descriptions, images, prices, availability, and more.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Think of it as your entire catalog in spreadsheet form. Each <\/span><b>row<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> represents a product; each <\/span><b>column<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is an attribute (title, price, brand, color, etc.).<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fa13ce3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fa13ce3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24f6828 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"24f6828\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"height: 91px;\" width=\"1461\"><tbody><tr><td><b>id<\/b><\/td><td><b>title<\/b><\/td><td><b>description<\/b><\/td><td><b>price<\/b><\/td><td><b>availability<\/b><\/td><td><b>image_link<\/b><\/td><td><b>brand<\/b><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">SKU123<\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Men&#8217;s Leather Wallet<\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Full-grain RFID wallet<\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">59.99 AUD<\/span><\/td><td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">in stock<\/span><\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/...\/wallet.jpg\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">https:\/\/&#8230;\/wallet.jpg<\/span><\/a><\/td><td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Brand\u00a0 Co<\/span><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-462a962 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"462a962\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Your e-commerce platform (such as Shopify, BigCommerce, Magento, or WooCommerce) typically creates this product feed automatically in formats like <b>XML<\/b>,\u00a0<b>CSV<\/b>, or\u00a0<b>TXT<\/b>. While tools like\u00a0<a href=\"http:\/\/www.feedops.com\/\"><b>FeedOps<\/b><\/a> can also generate this feed, they offer additional benefits by auditing, cleaning, and optimizing it to precisely match the unique requirements of each sales channel.\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-206aba3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"206aba3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-afdb71b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"afdb71b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ac10bf3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-menu-anchor\" data-id=\"ac10bf3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"menu-anchor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-menu-anchor\" id=\"how\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51a50bb elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"51a50bb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. How a Product Data Feed Act as the Language Between Your Store and Ad Platforms<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-997f4cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"997f4cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Every advertising or marketplace platform has its own rules for a product data feed.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your feed acts as the <\/span><b>translator<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> that converts your store data into the format those systems understand.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><strong>Examples:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Google Merchant Center<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> uses a product data feed\u00a0 to create Shopping Ads and Free Listings. Google also leverages product feeds for other services like local inventory ads, dynamic remarketing, and product data in Google Search.<\/span><\/li><li><b>Microsoft Merchant Center<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> reads nearly identical data for its Shopping campaigns. MSAN, or the Microsoft Shopping Ad Network, utilizes these feeds to display products across various Microsoft properties, including Bing, MSN, and Outlook.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Meta (Facebook &amp; Instagram)<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> uses catalog feeds to power Dynamic Product Ads that match items to users who viewed or abandoned them, and also leverages Advantage+ Shopping Campaigns to automate and optimize ad delivery across their platforms.<\/span><\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><b>Amazon<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Accurate and enriched product attributes are vital for e-commerce success on Amazon, boosting search rankings, discoverability, customer satisfaction, and conversions. Poor data results in penalties, while comprehensive details improve discoverability, inform purchases, and reduce returns, benefiting both vendors and Amazon.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b578625 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b578625\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If the translation is poor \u2014 missing fields, unclear titles, or mismatched categories \u2014 your ads and listings lose visibility.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When it\u2019s clean and complete, platforms can instantly understand:<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe4d518 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fe4d518\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c580753 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"c580753\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm0 48c110.532 0 200 89.451 200 200 0 110.532-89.451 200-200 200-110.532 0-200-89.451-200-200 0-110.532 89.451-200 200-200m140.204 130.267l-22.536-22.718c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.068L215.346 303.697l-59.792-60.277c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.069l-22.719 22.536c-4.705 4.667-4.736 12.265-.068 16.971l90.781 91.516c4.667 4.705 12.265 4.736 16.97.068l172.589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">what you sell<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-20ace63 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"20ace63\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm0 48c110.532 0 200 89.451 200 200 0 110.532-89.451 200-200 200-110.532 0-200-89.451-200-200 0-110.532 89.451-200 200-200m140.204 130.267l-22.536-22.718c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.068L215.346 303.697l-59.792-60.277c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.069l-22.719 22.536c-4.705 4.667-4.736 12.265-.068 16.971l90.781 91.516c4.667 4.705 12.265 4.736 16.97.068l172.589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">who it\u2019s for<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd5904b elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"bd5904b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm0 48c110.532 0 200 89.451 200 200 0 110.532-89.451 200-200 200-110.532 0-200-89.451-200-200 0-110.532 89.451-200 200-200m140.204 130.267l-22.536-22.718c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.068L215.346 303.697l-59.792-60.277c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.069l-22.719 22.536c-4.705 4.667-4.736 12.265-.068 16.971l90.781 91.516c4.667 4.705 12.265 4.736 16.97.068l172.589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">when it\u2019s available<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-000b19b elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"000b19b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm0 48c110.532 0 200 89.451 200 200 0 110.532-89.451 200-200 200-110.532 0-200-89.451-200-200 0-110.532 89.451-200 200-200m140.204 130.267l-22.536-22.718c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.068L215.346 303.697l-59.792-60.277c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.069l-22.719 22.536c-4.705 4.667-4.736 12.265-.068 16.971l90.781 91.516c4.667 4.705 12.265 4.736 16.97.068l172.589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">how to display it.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58fad06 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"58fad06\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">In short: \u00a0Your feed is the bridge between your store\u2019s inventory and every ad or listing that customers see online.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3769c6d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3769c6d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-94ff93b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"94ff93b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-72ba19a elementor-widget elementor-widget-menu-anchor\" data-id=\"72ba19a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"menu-anchor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-menu-anchor\" id=\"why\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb66063 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fb66063\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3. Why Feeds Matter More Today in AI Advertising\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4d78ab8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4d78ab8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI-driven ad systems have changed everything.\u00a0 In the old days, you picked keywords and audiences manually.\u00a0 Now systems like <\/span><b>Google Performance Max<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, <\/span><b>Microsoft Smart Shopping<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and <\/span><b>Meta Advantage+<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> use <\/span><b>machine learning<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to decide which shoppers see which products.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">That means they rely heavily on your <\/span><b>product data feed<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to understand your catalog and train their algorithms.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If your feed is vague or incomplete, the AI wastes spend showing your products to the wrong people. If it\u2019s rich and precise, the system learns fast, targets correctly, and sells efficiently.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>How Feed Quality Impacts Results<\/b><\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6937fae e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6937fae\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7182749 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"7182749\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm0 48c110.532 0 200 89.451 200 200 0 110.532-89.451 200-200 200-110.532 0-200-89.451-200-200 0-110.532 89.451-200 200-200m140.204 130.267l-22.536-22.718c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.068L215.346 303.697l-59.792-60.277c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.069l-22.719 22.536c-4.705 4.667-4.736 12.265-.068 16.971l90.781 91.516c4.667 4.705 12.265 4.736 16.97.068l172.589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Visibility:\u00a0Relevant, keyword-rich titles and attributes surface in more high-intent searches.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm0 48c110.532 0 200 89.451 200 200 0 110.532-89.451 200-200 200-110.532 0-200-89.451-200-200 0-110.532 89.451-200 200-200m140.204 130.267l-22.536-22.718c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.068L215.346 303.697l-59.792-60.277c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.069l-22.719 22.536c-4.705 4.667-4.736 12.265-.068 16.971l90.781 91.516c4.667 4.705 12.265 4.736 16.97.068l172.589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Click-Through Rate:\u00a0Better titles and imagery increase engagement<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm0 48c110.532 0 200 89.451 200 200 0 110.532-89.451 200-200 200-110.532 0-200-89.451-200-200 0-110.532 89.451-200 200-200m140.204 130.267l-22.536-22.718c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.068L215.346 303.697l-59.792-60.277c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.069l-22.719 22.536c-4.705 4.667-4.736 12.265-.068 16.971l90.781 91.516c4.667 4.705 12.265 4.736 16.97.068l172.589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Conversion Rate:\u00a0Accurate attributes help shoppers find exactly what they want.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-circle\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119.033 8 8 119.033 8 256s111.033 248 248 248 248-111.033 248-248S392.967 8 256 8zm0 48c110.532 0 200 89.451 200 200 0 110.532-89.451 200-200 200-110.532 0-200-89.451-200-200 0-110.532 89.451-200 200-200m140.204 130.267l-22.536-22.718c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.068L215.346 303.697l-59.792-60.277c-4.667-4.705-12.265-4.736-16.97-.069l-22.719 22.536c-4.705 4.667-4.736 12.265-.068 16.971l90.781 91.516c4.667 4.705 12.265 4.736 16.97.068l172.589-171.204c4.704-4.668 4.734-12.266.067-16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">ROAS:\u00a0Clean data lets algorithms spend smarter and reduce wasted budget.<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a378dc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2a378dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53655d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"53655d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Gemini_Generated_Image_qa2yq8qa2yq8qa2y.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5665\" alt=\"A side-by-side comparison of two e-commerce product cards for blue Nike running shoes. The left card shows a &quot;Weak Title&quot; (Running Shoes \u2013 Blue) and the right card shows an &quot;Optimized Title&quot; (Men\u2019s Lightweight Running Shoes \u2013 Blue Mesh \u2013 Size 10 \u2013 Nike Air Zoom).\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Gemini_Generated_Image_qa2yq8qa2yq8qa2y.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Gemini_Generated_Image_qa2yq8qa2yq8qa2y-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Gemini_Generated_Image_qa2yq8qa2yq8qa2y-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Gemini_Generated_Image_qa2yq8qa2yq8qa2y-768x768.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2c44dce e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2c44dce\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bd69911 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bd69911\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Example:<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29f9fa8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"29f9fa8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34c0718 elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"34c0718\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-window-close\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.5 32 0 53.5 0 80v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h416c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V80c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zm0 394c0 3.3-2.7 6-6 6H54c-3.3 0-6-2.7-6-6V86c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6h404c3.3 0 6 2.7 6 6v340zM356.5 194.6L295.1 256l61.4 61.4c4.6 4.6 4.6 12.1 0 16.8l-22.3 22.3c-4.6 4.6-12.1 4.6-16.8 0L256 295.1l-61.4 61.4c-4.6 4.6-12.1 4.6-16.8 0l-22.3-22.3c-4.6-4.6-4.6-12.1 0-16.8l61.4-61.4-61.4-61.4c-4.6-4.6-4.6-12.1 0-16.8l22.3-22.3c4.6-4.6 12.1-4.6 16.8 0l61.4 61.4 61.4-61.4c4.6-4.6 12.1-4.6 16.8 0l22.3 22.3c4.7 4.6 4.7 12.1 0 16.8z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">\u00a0Weak title:\u00a0\u201cRunning Shoes \u2013 Blue\u201d<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a097ed1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a097ed1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-14cf32a elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-list-item-link-full_width elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list\" data-id=\"14cf32a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-list.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"elementor-icon-list-items\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"elementor-icon-list-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-far-check-square\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M400 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h352c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zm0 400H48V80h352v352zm-35.864-241.724L191.547 361.48c-4.705 4.667-12.303 4.637-16.97-.068l-90.781-91.516c-4.667-4.705-4.637-12.303.069-16.971l22.719-22.536c4.705-4.667 12.303-4.637 16.97.069l59.792 60.277 141.352-140.216c4.705-4.667 12.303-4.637 16.97.068l22.536 22.718c4.667 4.706 4.637 12.304-.068 16.971z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-icon-list-text\">Optimized title:\u00a0\u201cMen\u2019s Lightweight Running Shoes \u2013 Blue Mesh \u2013 Size 10 \u2013 Nike Air Zoom\u201d<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1104fa6 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1104fa6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The optimized version gives both search engines and shoppers far more context, improving ranking, clicks, and conversions.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b5b298 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2b5b298\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4da3fb9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4da3fb9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f54e552 elementor-widget elementor-widget-menu-anchor\" data-id=\"f54e552\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"menu-anchor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-menu-anchor\" id=\"data\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66d363b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"66d363b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Website Data Quality Matters<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0569a52 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0569a52\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Garbage In, Garbage Out: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If your website data is incomplete or inconsistent (missing colors, wrong sizes, outdated prices), no feed optimization tool can fully fix it.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Structured Data Drives Search Results: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Google crawls your website and uses structured data (schema markup) to connect product details to ads and free listings. Clean data improves SEO and helps your ads sync correctly.<\/span><\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><b style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Automatic Feed Updates Depend on It: <\/b>A product data f<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">eed will often auto-sync daily or hourly. Poor website data means those errors constantly refresh into your Merchant Center or marketplace account.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Consistency Builds Trust: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shoppers notice when product info differs between your site and the ad they clicked. Consistent data across all channels increases conversion rates and reduces returns.\u00a0<\/span><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49a6cfb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"49a6cfb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"367\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Garbage-In-Garbage-Out.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5668\" alt=\"Garbage In, Garbage Out\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Garbage-In-Garbage-Out.png 1020w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Garbage-In-Garbage-Out-300x138.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Garbage-In-Garbage-Out-768x352.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fbd6067 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fbd6067\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21883eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"21883eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"541\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Website-Data-Quality-vs.-Ad-Performance-Infographic.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-5669\" alt=\"An infographic showing how high-quality website data (size, material, fit) creates better Google Shopping ads compared to poor data which leads to generic, low-performing ads.\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Website-Data-Quality-vs.-Ad-Performance-Infographic.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Website-Data-Quality-vs.-Ad-Performance-Infographic-300x203.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/Website-Data-Quality-vs.-Ad-Performance-Infographic-768x519.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6a49ba e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b6a49ba\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-832f44d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"832f44d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>Example:<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If your website product page lists \u201cBlue Shirt\u201d with no size, your Google Shopping ad will also lack a size attribute. But if your site clearly defines \u201cMen\u2019s Slim Fit Cotton Shirt \u2013 Blue \u2013 Size L,\u201d that same detail enriches your feed and helps AI match it to high-intent searches.<\/span><\/p><p><b>In short: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your website isn\u2019t just your storefront \u2014 it\u2019s the <\/span><b>source of truth<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for every advertising channel. Start by improving data quality at the source, and your feeds will follow.<\/span><\/p><h3 data-start=\"1465\" data-end=\"1524\">\u00a0<\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3c26bf5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3c26bf5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e79c81 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3e79c81\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42d9e88 elementor-widget elementor-widget-menu-anchor\" data-id=\"42d9e88\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"menu-anchor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-menu-anchor\" id=\"optimized\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-14bab8d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"14bab8d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">4. Connected Feeds vs Optimized Feeds<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-adb60df elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"adb60df\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Connecting your store to a channel is only step one. Optimization of a product data feed is what turns data into performance.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-955d7c8 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"955d7c8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-189e5e3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"189e5e3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d67d4de elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d67d4de\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>Connected Feed<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Automatically links your eCommerce platform to an ad channel or marketplace.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/2705.svg\" alt=\"\u2705\" \/> Pros: Quick setup, automatic syncing<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"emoji\" role=\"img\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"https:\/\/s.w.org\/images\/core\/emoji\/16.0.1\/svg\/274c.svg\" alt=\"\u274c\" \/> Cons: Generic data, missing fields, low discoverability<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><b>Example: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Shopify sends a feed to Google Merchant Center. Your products appear, but titles like <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cShirt \u2013 Blue\u201d<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> don\u2019t match search intent or trigger strong ads.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e90cd7d e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e90cd7d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11f9a45 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"11f9a45\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>Optimized Feed<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A refined, enhanced version designed for sales performance.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Optimization includes:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Filling missing attributes (color, size, material)<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rewriting titles with keyword relevance<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aligning categories and product types<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fixing capitalization, spacing, and special characters<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Resolving warnings or disapprovals<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.feedops.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> automates much of this work using AI, producing what we call a <\/span><b>sales-driven feed<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cba6ed1 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-laptop__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cba6ed1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Analogy: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A connected feed is a basic product list. An optimized feed is a data-powered salesperson that knows exactly how to pitch each item.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0aaa46a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0aaa46a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fb5cb2a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fb5cb2a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;gradient&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9b9487 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c9b9487\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d7ea459 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d7ea459\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9eb37e1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9eb37e1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>5. Common Feed Formats and Standards<\/b><\/h2><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Every major platform supports slightly different product data feed structures.\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Knowing the basics helps you stay compliant and save hours of troubleshooting.<\/span><\/p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Platform<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><b>Feed Format<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><b>Key Attributes<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><b>Notes<\/b><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Google Merchant Center<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">XML, TXT, Google Sheets<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">id, title, description, price, availability, image_link, brand, gtin, product_type<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Requires category mapping; powers Shopping Ads + Free Listings.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Microsoft Merchant Center<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">XML<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mirrors Google\u2019s structure<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Small attribute variations; accepts Google-formatted feeds.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Meta (Facebook\/Instagram)<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CSV, TSV, XML<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">id, title, description, availability, condition, image_link, link, brand<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Used for Dynamic Ads; sync daily or hourly.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Amazon Seller Central<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Flat File (CSV\/TSV), XML<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">sku, title, brand, product_type, price, bullet_points, description, image<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Category-specific templates; strict attribute rules.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Pinterest \/ TikTok \/ eBay<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">XML or CSV<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Similar core fields<\/span><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Focus on images, pricing, and availability accuracy.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3><b>Feed Standards<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most platforms align with universal schemas such as:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Google\u2019s Product Data Feed Specification<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Schema.org\/Product markup<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Open Graph Protocol<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> (for social platforms)<\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aligning your data with these standards ensures your listings render correctly across all ecosystems.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-12ec16b elementor-widget elementor-widget-menu-anchor\" data-id=\"12ec16b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"menu-anchor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-menu-anchor\" id=\"standards\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-078866a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"078866a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5106621 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"5106621\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa5c593 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"aa5c593\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><b>6. Summary &amp; Key Takeaways<\/b><\/h2><table><tbody><tr><td><p><b>Concept<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><b>Summary<\/b><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Definition<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A structured product data feed (file) describing every product in your catalog.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Purpose<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Acts as the language between your store and ad or marketplace platforms.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Modern Importance<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI-driven systems like PMax depend on feed quality to target effectively.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Website Data Quality<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Your website is the source of truth \u2014 fix data upstream for clean, consistent feeds.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Connected vs Optimized<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Connected feeds share raw data; optimized feeds enhance it for visibility and ROAS.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><tr><td><p><b>Formats &amp; Standards<\/b><\/p><\/td><td><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Each platform has unique specifications \u2014 accuracy and completeness are critical.<\/span><\/p><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h2>\u00a0<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1bc4669 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1bc4669\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b9ee9d0 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b9ee9d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FAQ: What is a Product Data Feed<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b811843 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b811843\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aa679e5 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion\" data-id=\"aa679e5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"nested-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-n-accordion\" aria-label=\"Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1780\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" open>\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1780\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What is a product data feed in eCommerce? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1780\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6808ae6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6808ae6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d15f77 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d15f77\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A product data feed is a structured file that lists every product in your online store. It includes attributes like title, description, price, image, brand, and availability. Platforms such as Google, Microsoft, Meta, and Amazon use this feed to display your products in Shopping ads and marketplace listings.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1781\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1781\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> Why is a product data feed important for Google Shopping and Microsoft Ads? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1781\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7eb86b7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7eb86b7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-56d9948 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"56d9948\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u00a0<\/p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Shopping platforms rely on feed data to understand your products. High-quality feeds improve visibility, relevance, and ad performance. Poor or incomplete data reduces impressions and leads to wasted spend.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1782\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1782\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> How does a product data feed impact AI-driven advertising campaigns? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1782\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab6ee77 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ab6ee77\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9823dba elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9823dba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">AI systems like Google Performance Max and Meta Advantage+ use your product feed to match items with search intent. The richer your data, the faster these algorithms learn and the more efficiently they target high-value shoppers.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1783\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1783\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\">  What are the most important attributes in a Google Shopping feed? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1783\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1b88769 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1b88769\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ae1890 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7ae1890\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Google\u2019s key attributes include: <\/span><b>id, title, description, price, availability, image_link, brand, gtin, product_type, google_product_category. <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Complete and accurate attributes help your products appear in more high-intent searches.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1784\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"5\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1784\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What is the difference between a connected feed and an optimized product feed? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1784\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7a550a5 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7a550a5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a481ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a481ad\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-c8e6dd48-7fff-86e1-7477-f316ef6b159c\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">A connected feed simply synchronizes your store\u2019s data with a channel. An optimized feed enhances that data by improving titles, filling missing attributes, aligning categories, and fixing disapprovals. Optimized feeds drive more impressions, clicks, and ROAS.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1785\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"6\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1785\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> How does website data quality affect my product feed? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1785\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6ee1ae7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6ee1ae7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be9f0fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"be9f0fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most feeds pull data directly from your product pages. If your website contains missing sizes, unclear titles, outdated prices, or inconsistent attributes, those issues flow into your Shopping feed and hurt your ad performance. Clean website data results in stronger feeds and better AI targeting.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1786\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"7\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1786\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What happens if my feed is missing required or recommended fields? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1786\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4342e61 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4342e61\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1c60eaf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1c60eaf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Missing fields reduce product visibility. Platforms may:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Reject your products<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Limit impressions<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Show your items for irrelevant searches<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Lower your overall Shopping performance<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Improving attribute completeness is one of the fastest ways to increase impressions and clicks.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1787\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"8\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1787\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\">  How often should a Google Shopping or marketplace feed update? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1787\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-542c31e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"542c31e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-14f56dc elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"14f56dc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Most channels expect <\/span><b>daily or hourly<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> updates. Frequent updates keep pricing, availability, and stock levels accurate across Google, Microsoft, Amazon, Meta, and other marketplaces.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1788\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"9\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1788\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\">  Can one product feed work across multiple platforms? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1788\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b55e835 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b55e835\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-48e3b0f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"48e3b0f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can submit a single source feed, but each platform has unique rules and formatting. Google, Microsoft, Meta, and Amazon require different attributes and category structures. FeedOps automatically adapts your data to each channel\u2019s specification.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1789\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"10\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1789\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> How do optimized product titles improve Shopping performance? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-1789\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a1bc71 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1a1bc71\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c3b645e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c3b645e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Optimized titles increase visibility in relevant searches. A strong title includes the brand, product type, key attributes, and model or variant.<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Roboto,sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br \/><\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Example:\u00a0 <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\u201cMen\u2019s Lightweight Running Shoes \u2013 Blue Mesh \u2013 Size 10 \u2013 Nike Air Zoom.\u201d <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">\u00a0More context \u2192 more relevant traffic \u2192 higher click-through rates.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17810\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"11\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17810\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What file formats do Google, Microsoft, Meta, and Amazon accept for product feeds? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17810\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11c1165 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"11c1165\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-79101e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"79101e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Common formats include XML, CSV, TSV, and TXT.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Google Merchant Center:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> XML, TXT, Google Sheets<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Microsoft Merchant Center:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> XML<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Meta catalog:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> CSV, TSV, XML<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Amazon Seller Central:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Flat file templates (CSV\/TSV) or XML<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17811\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"12\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17811\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What is Schema.org Product markup, and why does it matter for feeds? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17811\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b422148 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b422148\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecb7721 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ecb7721\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Schema.org Product markup helps Google understand your product pages. Strong schema improves SEO, ensures data consistency, and helps Shopping ads and Free Listings sync correctly. Better structured data reduces feed errors and increases discoverability.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17812\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"13\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17812\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\">  How do I know if my product feed needs optimization? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17812\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1ea00da e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1ea00da\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b4715d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b4715d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You likely need feed optimization if you see:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Low impressions<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Weak click-through rates<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Incorrect search queries<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Frequent Merchant Center disapprovals<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Missing or inconsistent product attributes<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> These issues limit visibility and reduce Shopping performance.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17813\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"14\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17813\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> What does FeedOps improve in a product data feed? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17813\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a336a3b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"a336a3b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c70512a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c70512a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps enhances product data by:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Filling missing attributes<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rewriting titles with keyword relevance<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fixing Merchant Center warnings and disapprovals<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Aligning categories and product types<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cleaning formatting and data inconsistencies.\u00a0<\/span><\/li><\/ul><div>\u00a0<\/div><p>This creates a <b style=\"background-color: transparent;\">sales-ready feed<\/b><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"> for Google, Microsoft, Meta, Amazon, and marketplaces.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-17814\" class=\"e-n-accordion-item\" >\n\t\t\t\t<summary class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title\" data-accordion-index=\"15\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-17814\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class=\"e-n-accordion-item-title-text\"> How can I quickly improve my Shopping feed today? <\/div><\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-opened' ><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-minus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t\t<span class='e-closed'><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-plus\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"><\/path><\/svg><\/span>\n\t\t<\/span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/summary>\n\t\t\t\t<div role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-accordion-item-17814\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b63e63b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b63e63b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1949e0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1949e0e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Start with:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Clear, keyword-focused titles<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Complete attributes (size, color, material, gender, fit)<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">High-quality images<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Correct categorization and product types<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Accurate stock status and pricing<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These updates help algorithms match your products with the right shoppers.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/details>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-452f79e e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"452f79e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2f15526 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"2f15526\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- \u2705 QUIZ SECTION (Drop-in) -->\n<section id=\"quiz\" class=\"quiz-wrap\" aria-labelledby=\"quiz-title\">\n  <div class=\"quiz-card\">\n    <header class=\"quiz-header\">\n      <h2 id=\"quiz-title\">Take the Quiz<\/h2>\n      <p class=\"quiz-subtitle\">\n        Check your understanding of how product feeds power AI-driven eCommerce ads.\n      <\/p>\n\n      <div class=\"quiz-meta\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <span id=\"progressText\">Question 1 of 8<\/span>\n        <span id=\"scoreHint\" class=\"muted\">Submit to see your score<\/span>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"8\" aria-valuenow=\"1\">\n        <div id=\"progressBar\" class=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width: 12.5%\"><\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/header>\n\n    <form id=\"quizForm\" class=\"quiz-body\" novalidate>\n      <!-- Questions injected by JS -->\n      <div id=\"questions\"><\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"quiz-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"btnPrev\" class=\"btn secondary\" disabled>Back<\/button>\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn secondar\">Next<\/button>\n        <button type=\"submit\" id=\"btnSubmit\" class=\"btn primary\" style=\"display:none;\">\n          Submit Quiz\n        <\/button>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <p id=\"formError\" class=\"error\" role=\"alert\" aria-live=\"assertive\" hidden>\n        Please select an option before continuing.\n      <\/p>\n    <\/form>\n  <\/div>\n\n  <!-- \u2705 RESULT MODAL -->\n  <div id=\"resultModal\" class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"modalTitle\" aria-describedby=\"modalDesc\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"modal-backdrop\" data-close=\"true\"><\/div>\n    <div class=\"modal-panel\" role=\"document\">\n      <button class=\"modal-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Close\" data-close=\"true\">\u2715<\/button>\n\n      <h3 id=\"modalTitle\">Your Results<\/h3>\n      <p id=\"modalDesc\" class=\"muted\">\n        Score summary and next step.\n      <\/p>\n\n      <div class=\"result-box\">\n        <div class=\"result-score\">\n          <div class=\"score-number\" id=\"scoreNumber\">0\/8<\/div>\n          <div class=\"score-percent\" id=\"scorePercent\">0%<\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n        <div class=\"result-message\" id=\"scoreMessage\">\n          <!-- filled by JS -->\n        <\/div>\n\n        <details class=\"result-details\" id=\"answerReview\" style=\"margin-top:14px;\">\n          <summary>Review answers<\/summary>\n          <div id=\"reviewList\" class=\"review-list\"><\/div>\n        <\/details>\n      <\/div>\n\n      <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n        <button type=\"button\" id=\"btnRetry\" class=\"btn secondary\">Retry Quiz<\/button>\n\n        <!-- \u2705 NEXT COURSE CTA -->\n        <a id=\"nextCourseCta\" class=\"btn primary\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-feeds-power-ai-in-ecommerce-ads\/\">\n          Move to Next Course \u2192\n        <\/a>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<style>\n    \n    :root {\n  --bg-cream: #fff8ed;\n  --card-bg: #ffffff;\n  --border: #e6e1d8;\n  --text-main: #1a1a1a;\n  --text-muted: #6f6a63;\n\n  --orange-main: #f59e0b;     \/* FeedOps orange *\/\n  --orange-soft: #fff1d6;\n  --orange-hover: #e68a00;\n\n  --success: #2fbf71;\n  --error: #e5533d;\n}\n\n\/* Wrapper *\/\n.quiz-wrap {\n  padding: 32px 16px;\n  background: var(--bg-cream);\n}\n\n\/* Card *\/\n.quiz-card {\n  max-width: 880px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);\n}\n\n\/* Header *\/\n.quiz-header {\n  padding: 24px 24px 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.quiz-header h2 {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  font-size: 26px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.quiz-subtitle {\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n.quiz-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n\/* Progress *\/\n.progress {\n  height: 8px;\n  background: #f0ede7;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.progress-bar {\n  height: 100%;\n  background: var(--orange-main);\n  transition: width 0.25s ease;\n}\n\n\/* Body *\/\n.quiz-body {\n  padding: 24px;\n}\n\n.q-card {\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  background: #fffdf9;\n}\n\n.q-title {\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.q-help {\n  margin: 0 0 16px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n\/* Options *\/\n.options {\n  display: grid;\n\n  gap: 12px;\n  align-items: center;\n  \n}\n\n.opt {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 10px;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  background: #ffffff;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: border 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.opt:hover {\n  border-color: var(--orange-main);\n  background: var(--orange-soft);\n}\n\n.opt input {\n  margin-top: 4px;\n}\n\n.opt span {\n  color: var(--text-main);\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n\/* Actions *\/\n.quiz-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  padding: 10px 16px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  background: #ffffff;\n  color: var(--text-main);\n}\n\n.btn.secondary:hover {\n  background: #f6f4ef;\n}\n\n.btn.primary {\n  background: var(--orange-main);\n  border-color: var(--orange-main);\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.btn.primary:hover {\n  background: var(--orange-hover);\n}\n\n.btn:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n.error {\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  color: var(--error);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n\/* Modal *\/\n.modal {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n.modal-backdrop {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n}\n\n.modal-panel {\n  position: relative;\n  width: min(760px, 92%);\n  background: var(--card-bg);\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  padding: 24px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.modal-close {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 12px;\n  right: 12px;\n  border: none;\n  background: none;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.result-box {\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  background: #fffdf9;\n  max-height: 400px;\n  overflow: scroll;\n}\n\n.result-score {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.score-number {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.score-percent {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.result-message {\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n}\n\n.review-item {\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  background: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.tag.ok {\n  color: var(--success);\n}\n\n.tag.no {\n  color: var(--error);\n}\n\n.modal-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n}\n .modal[hidden] {\n  display: none;\n}\n[type=button]:focus, [type=button]:hover, [type=submit]:focus, [type=submit]:hover, button:focus, button:hover {\n    color: gray;\n    background-color: white;\n    text-decoration: none;\n}\n<\/style>\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    \/\/ \u2705 Edit quiz count\/content here if you want\n    const QUIZ = [\n      {\n        id: \"q1\",\n        question: \"In AI-powered ad platforms, what role does a product feed play?\",\n        help: \"Think: what the system uses to understand products and generate\/target ads.\",\n        options: [\n          \"A place to set manual keywords and bids only\",\n          \"A structured data source that tells platforms what products are and how to show them\",\n          \"A pixel that tracks purchases\",\n          \"A creative library for banners\"\n        ],\n        answerIndex: 1\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"q2\",\n        question: \"Which attributes are most directly used by AI to understand and match products to queries and audiences?\",\n        help: \"Pick the option that contains product-level details.\",\n        options: [\n          \"Title, price, color, product type\",\n          \"Office address and business hours only\",\n          \"Refund policy only\",\n          \"Competitor pricing only\"\n        ],\n        answerIndex: 0\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"q3\",\n        question: \"Why does data completeness and accuracy improve targeting?\",\n        help: \"Better data helps systems classify items and predict who will buy.\",\n        options: [\n          \"It guarantees 100% conversion rate\",\n          \"It gives the algorithm richer signals to learn relevance and intent\",\n          \"It removes the need for images\",\n          \"It disables automated optimization\"\n        ],\n        answerIndex: 1\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"q4\",\n        question: \"What is a common outcome of a poor-quality feed (missing fields, vague titles, mismatched categories)?\",\n        help: \"Consider how AI behaves when it can\u2019t understand products well.\",\n        options: [\n          \"Lower visibility and wasted spend due to weak relevance\",\n          \"Automatically higher ROAS because the algorithm compensates\",\n          \"More impressions only on high-intent searches\",\n          \"No effect\u2014feeds don\u2019t impact campaigns\"\n        ],\n        answerIndex: 0\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"q5\",\n        question: \"Which statement best describes 'Connected feed' vs 'Optimized feed'?\",\n        help: \"Connected = raw sync. Optimized = performance-focused improvements.\",\n        options: [\n          \"Connected feeds are manually typed; optimized feeds are not allowed\",\n          \"Connected feeds sync store data; optimized feeds enhance titles\/attributes for discoverability and ROAS\",\n          \"Connected feeds only work on Meta; optimized feeds only work on Google\",\n          \"Connected feeds are images; optimized feeds are videos\"\n        ],\n        answerIndex: 1\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"q6\",\n        question: \"How does website data quality influence feed performance?\",\n        help: \"Your site is often the source of truth for feed values and updates.\",\n        options: [\n          \"It doesn\u2019t matter\u2014feeds ignore website data\",\n          \"Poor site data refreshes errors into Merchant Center\/marketplaces during sync\",\n          \"Only affects email marketing, not ads\",\n          \"Only affects shipping speed\"\n        ],\n        answerIndex: 1\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"q7\",\n        question: \"Why can a simple title change improve Performance Max results?\",\n        help: \"Think search matching, classification, and relevance signals.\",\n        options: [\n          \"It increases battery life of mobile devices\",\n          \"It gives clearer intent keywords and attributes, improving matching and CTR\/conversions\",\n          \"It forces Google to lower CPC\",\n          \"It replaces the need for product images\"\n        ],\n        answerIndex: 1\n      },\n      {\n        id: \"q8\",\n        question: \"How does FeedOps align feed data with campaign goals (sales, discovery, local)?\",\n        help: \"Consider adjusting fields to match the channel objective.\",\n        options: [\n          \"By turning off attributes to simplify the feed\",\n          \"By enriching and structuring attributes\/titles\/categories to fit each campaign objective\",\n          \"By running only brand keywords\",\n          \"By pausing products with inventory\"\n        ],\n        answerIndex: 1\n      }\n    ];\n\n    const elQuestions = document.getElementById(\"questions\");\n    const form = document.getElementById(\"quizForm\");\n    const btnPrev = document.getElementById(\"btnPrev\");\n    const btnNext = document.getElementById(\"btnNext\");\n    const btnSubmit = document.getElementById(\"btnSubmit\");\n    const formError = document.getElementById(\"formError\");\n    const progressText = document.getElementById(\"progressText\");\n    const progressBar = document.getElementById(\"progressBar\");\n    const progress = document.querySelector(\".progress\");\n\n    const modal = document.getElementById(\"resultModal\");\n    const scoreNumber = document.getElementById(\"scoreNumber\");\n    const scorePercent = document.getElementById(\"scorePercent\");\n    const scoreMessage = document.getElementById(\"scoreMessage\");\n    const reviewList = document.getElementById(\"reviewList\");\n    const btnRetry = document.getElementById(\"btnRetry\");\n    const nextCourseCta = document.getElementById(\"nextCourseCta\");\n\n    \/\/ \u2705 Set your real next lesson URL or route\n    nextCourseCta.href = \"https:\/\/feedops.com\/how-feeds-power-ai-in-ecommerce-ads\/\"; \/\/ change this\n\n    \/\/ State\n    let currentIndex = 0;\n    const answers = new Array(QUIZ.length).fill(null);\n\n    function renderCurrentQuestion() {\n      elQuestions.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n      const q = QUIZ[currentIndex];\n\n      const card = document.createElement(\"div\");\n      card.className = \"q-card\";\n      card.setAttribute(\"data-qid\", q.id);\n\n      const title = document.createElement(\"h3\");\n      title.className = \"q-title\";\n      title.textContent = q.question;\n\n      const help = document.createElement(\"p\");\n      help.className = \"q-help\";\n      help.textContent = q.help || \"\";\n\n      const opts = document.createElement(\"div\");\n      opts.className = \"options\";\n      opts.setAttribute(\"role\", \"radiogroup\");\n      opts.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", `Options for ${q.question}`);\n\n      q.options.forEach((text, idx) => {\n        const label = document.createElement(\"label\");\n        label.className = \"opt\";\n\n        const input = document.createElement(\"input\");\n        input.type = \"radio\";\n        input.name = q.id;\n        input.value = String(idx);\n        input.checked = answers[currentIndex] === idx;\n\n        input.addEventListener(\"change\", () => {\n          answers[currentIndex] = idx;\n          formError.hidden = true;\n        });\n\n        const span = document.createElement(\"span\");\n        span.textContent = text;\n\n        label.appendChild(input);\n        label.appendChild(span);\n        opts.appendChild(label);\n      });\n\n      card.appendChild(title);\n      if (q.help) card.appendChild(help);\n      card.appendChild(opts);\n\n      elQuestions.appendChild(card);\n\n      updateNav();\n      updateProgress();\n    }\n\n    function updateNav() {\n      btnPrev.disabled = currentIndex === 0;\n      const last = currentIndex === QUIZ.length - 1;\n      btnNext.style.display = last ? \"none\" : \"inline-flex\";\n      btnSubmit.style.display = last ? \"inline-flex\" : \"none\";\n    }\n\n    function updateProgress() {\n      const qNum = currentIndex + 1;\n      progressText.textContent = `Question ${qNum} of ${QUIZ.length}`;\n      const pct = (qNum \/ QUIZ.length) * 100;\n      progressBar.style.width = pct + \"%\";\n      progress.setAttribute(\"aria-valuenow\", String(qNum));\n      progress.setAttribute(\"aria-valuemax\", String(QUIZ.length));\n    }\n\n    function requireAnswerOrError() {\n      if (answers[currentIndex] === null) {\n        formError.hidden = false;\n        return false;\n      }\n      formError.hidden = true;\n      return true;\n    }\n\n    btnPrev.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (currentIndex > 0) currentIndex--;\n      renderCurrentQuestion();\n    });\n\n    btnNext.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      if (!requireAnswerOrError()) return;\n      if (currentIndex < QUIZ.length - 1) currentIndex++;\n      renderCurrentQuestion();\n    });\n\n    form.addEventListener(\"submit\", (e) => {\n      e.preventDefault();\n\n      \/\/ Ensure last question answered\n      if (!requireAnswerOrError()) return;\n\n      const results = QUIZ.map((q, i) => {\n        const chosen = answers[i];\n        const correct = q.answerIndex;\n        return {\n          question: q.question,\n          chosen,\n          correct,\n          isCorrect: chosen === correct,\n          chosenText: chosen === null ? \"(No answer)\" : q.options[chosen],\n          correctText: q.options[correct]\n        };\n      });\n\n      const correctCount = results.filter(r => r.isCorrect).length;\n      const total = QUIZ.length;\n      const percent = Math.round((correctCount \/ total) * 100);\n\n      scoreNumber.textContent = `${correctCount}\/${total}`;\n      scorePercent.textContent = `${percent}%`;\n\n      \/\/ Message\n      let msg = \"\";\n      if (percent >= 90) msg = \"Excellent \u2014 your feed & AI fundamentals are solid. Ready for the next lesson.\";\n      else if (percent >= 70) msg = \"Good work \u2014 you\u2019ve got the core concepts. Review the missed ones and continue.\";\n      else if (percent >= 50) msg = \"Decent start \u2014 revisit feed completeness, titles, and website data quality, then continue.\";\n      else msg = \"Let\u2019s tighten the basics \u2014 focus on how attributes drive matching and why quality prevents wasted spend.\";\n\n      scoreMessage.textContent = msg;\n\n      \/\/ Review list\n      reviewList.innerHTML = \"\";\n      results.forEach((r, idx) => {\n        const item = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        item.className = \"review-item\";\n\n        const h = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        h.style.fontWeight = \"800\";\n        h.style.color = \"var(--text)\";\n        h.textContent = `Q${idx + 1}. ${r.question}`;\n\n        const tag = document.createElement(\"span\");\n        tag.className = \"tag \" + (r.isCorrect ? \"ok\" : \"no\");\n        tag.textContent = r.isCorrect ? \"Correct\" : \"Incorrect\";\n        h.appendChild(tag);\n\n        const p1 = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        p1.style.marginTop = \"8px\";\n        p1.style.color = \"var(--muted)\";\n        p1.textContent = `Your answer: ${r.chosenText}`;\n\n        const p2 = document.createElement(\"div\");\n        p2.style.marginTop = \"6px\";\n        p2.style.color = \"var(--muted)\";\n        p2.textContent = `Correct answer: ${r.correctText}`;\n\n        item.appendChild(h);\n        item.appendChild(p1);\n        item.appendChild(p2);\n        reviewList.appendChild(item);\n      });\n\n      openModal();\n    });\n\n    function openModal() {\n      modal.hidden = false;\n      document.body.style.overflow = \"hidden\";\n      \/\/ focus close button for accessibility\n      const closeBtn = modal.querySelector(\"[data-close='true']\");\n      if (closeBtn) closeBtn.focus();\n    }\n\n    function closeModal() {\n      modal.hidden = true;\n      document.body.style.overflow = \"\";\n    }\n\n    modal.addEventListener(\"click\", (e) => {\n      const target = e.target;\n      if (target && target.getAttribute(\"data-close\") === \"true\") closeModal();\n    });\n\n    document.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n      if (!modal.hidden && e.key === \"Escape\") closeModal();\n    });\n\n    btnRetry.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n      \/\/ reset\n      for (let i = 0; i < answers.length; i++) answers[i] = null;\n      currentIndex = 0;\n      closeModal();\n      renderCurrentQuestion();\n      document.getElementById(\"scoreHint\").textContent = \"Submit to see your score\";\n    });\n\n    \/\/ Init\n    renderCurrentQuestion();\n  })();\n<\/script>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>&gt; Learning &gt; What Is a Product Data Feed What Is a Product Data Feed? A product data feed is the digital DNA of your online store. It\u2019s how platforms like Google, Microsoft, Meta, and Amazon learn what you sell, who it\u2019s for, and how to display it. When you run shopping ads or list [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":5658,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5671","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>What Is a Product Data Feed? A Simple Guide for eCommerce<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"What is a product data feed, how it powers Google Shopping, Microsoft, Meta and Amazon, and why feed quality drives AI-ad performance.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"What Is a Product Data Feed? A Simple Guide for eCommerce&quot;\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A clear explanation of product data feeds and how they fuel Google Shopping, Microsoft, Meta and Amazon. Part of FeedOps&#039; free Product Feed Mastery course.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-12-29T01:57:18+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/How-Feeds-Power-AI-in-eCommerce-Ads-feedops.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1920\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1080\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"What is a Product Data Feed\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"19 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/\",\"name\":\"What Is a Product Data Feed? A Simple Guide for eCommerce\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/what-is-product-data-feeds\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/How-Feeds-Power-AI-in-eCommerce-Ads-feedops.png\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-12-23T05:10:57+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-12-29T01:57:18+00:00\",\"description\":\"What is a product data feed, how it powers Google Shopping, Microsoft,